    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 20 Tullacmongan; a traditional 3 bedroom terraced residence located in an established residential area of Cavan town adjacent to Breffni Park and within minutes' walk from the town centre.The bright and well-proportioned accommodation is well arranged and extends to 73 sq. m approx. comprising; entrance hall, sitting, kitchen / dining room, bathroom and 3 bedrooms. To the rear of the property there is an enclosed garden with utility shed. To the front a delightful enclosed west facing gravelled area with mature shrubs.Local facilities in the area are in abundance and include a variety of excellent schools (both Primary & Secondary), leisure facilities, shops, restaurants and many other necessary amenities.The property would make an ideal starter home, investment or equally suited to those wishing to downsize. Viewing by appointment only with the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.85m x 2.40m\nVinyl flooring, carpet to first floor.\n\nSitting Room - 4.90m x 3.65m\nLaminate flooring, wrought iron insert with solid fuel stove.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.71m x 2.44m\nTiled flooring, oil fired range, door to rear, hot press.\n\nW.C. / Shower - 2.22m x 1.63m\nVinyl flooring, w.c., wash hand basin, electric shower, part tiled.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.90m x 2.67m\nVinyl flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.75m x 2.35m\nVinyl flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.75m x 2.40m\nVinyl flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Convenient town location.</li><li>Oil fired central heating. </li><li>Mains Services.</li><li>Rear elevated garden. </li><li>Enclosed west facing area to the front.</ul>"
      },
